│ required fields with a blank option. The fix │
│ involves modifying the render method within  │
│ the RadioSelect widget to prevent the blank  │
│ option from being rendered when a required   │
│ field is being displayed. This will ensure   │
│ that only valid choices are presented to the │
│ user.                                        │
