│ widget incorrectly renders a blank option    │
│ ("---------") when a foreign key field is    │
│ present and blank=False. This is because the │
│ widget doesn't properly handle the absence   │
│ of a selected value for a ForeignKey field.  │
│ The fix is to prevent the widget from        │
│ rendering the blank option when a valid      │
│ foreign key value is present. This can be    │
│ achieved by conditionally suppressing the    │
│ rendering of the blank option based on       │
│ whether a value is selected.                 │
